            "review_text": "Shiikha_Dutt\nColombo, Sri Lanka111 contributions\n0\nA must visit. Make sure you have a reservation though\nMar 2026 • Couples\nThis speakeasy is absolutely worth all the hype. The ambiance is intimate and effortlessly cool, and the cocktails are crafted to perfection. Every drink we tried was impressive, but the standout for me was the banh mi cocktail—creative, bold, and surprisingly well-balanced. Definitely a must-visit for cocktail lovers.\nWritten April 17, 2026",
