            "review_title": "Review at United Bar",
            "review_text": "Pauls\nCaversham, United Kingdom44 contributions\n0\nGreat cocktails.\nAug 2024 • Couples\nThis is a cool little bar in Danang city.\nIt's main gimmick/attraction is the entrance.....hidden behind what looks like a Banh Mi street vendor stall.\nOnce inside it's quite small - can fit 18/20 people. We got a table OK but we saw people being turned because there were no seats left.\nTheir signature cocktails were based around Vietnamese foods - their Banh Mi cocktail was EXCELLENT and had a great spiciness to it (green chilli).\nPrices were a little bit higher than other bars in the city area but in line with what you'd pay over at the beach and were still very cheap when compared to what you'd pay at somewhere similar in Europe.\nThe only downside was that they had a TV screen playing Mr.Bean cartoons! Which was so out of keeping with the vibe of the place it just seemed really odd!\nIf you enjoy great cocktails and finding somewhere a bit quirky then you should go....but if you just want a cheap drink, or somewhere with a view, then give it a miss.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nHave a plan B in mind as you may not get in if the bar is busy.\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 27, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
